  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Nove de Paus fala de resistência, alerta e defesa.",
      "Ele representa quem lutou muito e segue de guarda alta.",
      "O foco dele é: usar a força sem ficar preso no hábito da luta."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Nine of Wands speaks of resilience, alertness and defence.",
      "It stands for someone who has fought a lot and keeps their guard up.",
      "Its focus: using strength without getting trapped in the habit of fighting."
    ]
  },
